        "raw": "<p>I&#39;m trying to make sure I&#39;m playing destroyed mission rewards correctly.&nbsp; According to the rulebook, destroyed rewards go into that hero&#39;s trash, so I presume they can be shuffled into that hero&#39;s deck and redrawn (or retrieved from the trash with the appropriate effects)?&nbsp; They don&#39;t have cardbacks, so I assume you put them in the deck reward side up and you just get to know they&#39;re coming.</p><p>And specifically, this seems absurdly good with being able to use and re-use the Blood Stone.&nbsp; Am I misunderstanding this rule?</p>",
