        "id": 221615,
        "name": "bishop083",
        "username": "bishop083",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/eb8c5e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-19T13:56:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a question on this, related to devastation tokens. I can’t remember the exact wording, and my friend owns the game so I can’t exactly go check whenever I want. Do devastation tokens get added only when the hero characters are incapacitated? Or do they also get added when a hero reward is knocked out? I know that we interpreted the rule as only adding devastation tokens when a hero character card is incapacitated, but I wanted to double check.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:54:19.938Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
