      {
        "id": 221616,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-19T13:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When a hero is incapped is a token added. &nbsp; For the Sentinels all four need to be incapped before a token is added. &nbsp; The reward heroes are not hero character cards but just hero targets so they don’t add a token when destroyed.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:54:20.007Z",
